ility Requirements", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Define scaling requirements for users, data volume, transactions, and geographic distribution."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Define scaling requirements for users, data volume, transactions, and geographic distribution.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Usability Requirements", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Specify usability requirements: accessibility (WCAG), localization, user training, and documentation."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Specify usability requirements: accessibility (WCAG), localization, user training, and documentation.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Compliance Requirements", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Detail regulatory and standards compliance requirements (GDPR, HIPAA, SOC 2, PCI-DSS)."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Detail regulatory and standards compliance requirements (GDPR, HIPAA, SOC 2, PCI-DSS).]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1}, "content": [{"text": "Verification", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Describe how each requirement will be verified."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Describe how each requirement will be verified.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Verification Methods", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Define verification methods for each requirement: inspection, analysis, demonstration, or test."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Define verification methods for each requirement: inspection, analysis, demonstration, or test.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": 