cf5688fd-5b8c-499e-a27c-a7a0c203fe29	Mutual Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA)	Bilateral confidentiality agreement protecting both parties' confidential information during business discussions.	{"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1}, "content": [{"text": "Parties and Recitals", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Identify the parties and establish the purpose of the confidentiality agreement."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Identify the parties and establish the purpose of the confidentiality agreement.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Party Identification", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Identify both disclosing and receiving parties with full legal names, addresses, and jurisdictions of incorporation."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Identify both disclosing and receiving parties with full legal names, addresses, and jurisdictions of incorporation.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Purpose and Background", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "State the business purpose for which confidential information will be shared (e.g., potential business relationship, merger discussions, joint venture evaluation)."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: State the business purpose for which confidential information will be shared (e.g., potential business relationship, merger discussions, joint venture evaluation).]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1}, "content": [{"text": "Confidential Information Definition", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Define what constitutes confidential information under the agreement."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Define what constitutes confidential information under the agreement.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Scope of Confidential Information", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Define confidential information broadly: technical data, business plans, financial information, customer lists, trade secrets, proprietary processes, and all information marked confidential."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Define confidential information broadly: technical data, business plans, financial information, customer lists, trade secrets, proprietary processes, and all information marked confidential.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Exclusions from Confidential Information", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Define standard exclusions: publicly available information, independently developed information, information received from third parties without restriction, and information disclosed with prior written consent."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Define standard exclusions: publicly available information, independently developed information, information received from third parties without restriction, and information disclosed with prior written consent.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Marking Requirements", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Specify how confidential information must be marked (written: 'Confidential'; oral: confirmed in writing within specified days)."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Specify how confidential information must be marked (written: 'Confidential'; oral: confirmed in writing within specified days).]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1}, "content": [{"text": "Obligations of Receiving Party", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Detail the obligations of parties receiving confidential information."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Detail the obligations of parties receiving confidential information.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Non-Disclosure Obligations", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Prohibit disclosure to third parties except as expressly permitted, require same degree of care as own confidential information (not less than reasonable care)."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Prohibit disclosure to third parties except as expressly permitted, require same degree of care as own confidential information (not less than reasonable care).]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Permitted Use", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Limit use of confidential information solely for the stated purpose; prohibit reverse engineering, copying, or derivative works."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Limit use of confidential information solely for the stated purpose; prohibit reverse engineering, copying, or derivative works.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Authorized Recipients", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Define who may receive confidential information (employees, contractors, advisors with need-to-know) and require binding confidentiality obligations for such recipients."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Define who may receive confidential information (employees, contractors, advisors with need-to-know) and require binding confidentiality obligations for such recipients.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1}, "content": [{"text": "Compelled Disclosu