12b19e6e-6638-427b-a56a-1223b22d8085	Invoice - Cost Plus	Cost-plus contract invoice with fee calculation.	{"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1}, "content": [{"text": "Cost Plus Invoice", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Create cost-plus invoice with proper fee calculation."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Create cost-plus invoice with proper fee calculation.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Invoice Header", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Create invoice header with complete company and contract information."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Create invoice header with complete company and contract information.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Direct Costs", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Detail all direct costs including labor, materials, and ODCs."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Detail all direct costs including labor, materials, and ODCs.]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Indirect Costs", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Calculate indirect costs using approved rates (fringe, overhead, G&A)."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Calculate indirect costs using approved rates (fringe, overhead, G&A).]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Fee Calculation", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"data-ai-prompt": "Calculate fee based on contract type (fixed fee or incentive fee)."}, "content": [{"text": "[AI will generate content based on: Calculate fee based on contract type (fixed fee or incentive fee).]", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}